  message: "Implementation merged in commit 040bacf6e (\"docs(hooks): mention session-end agent-notes refresh in recover-state hook summary (WI-nisop)\") on dev. The PLAYBOOKS entry at .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py:240-256 now includes the session-end refresh language (\"Before signing off ... append a one-paragraph summary ... via scripts/agent-notes --append. The during-session 'keep notes fresh' rule covers updates as you go; the session-end refresh is the symmetric write obligation that closes the recovery loop\"). Closes the WI-borur (a) follow-up. WI-borur (b) (stop hook nudge on stale agent_notes.json mtime) remains deferred per the user's direction."  # 5242
